# Raspi-LINK-Display line ending policy
# Enforce LF for all text files for cross-platform consistency (Windows <-> Linux/Pi)

* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.cpp text eol=lf
*.h text eol=lf
*.hpp text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
*.cmake text eol=lf
CMakeLists.txt text eol=lf

# Do not touch binary files
*.ttf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.zip binary
*.tar.gz binary
*.o binary
*.obj binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
